Accept: application/json
Cookie: token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..7Cn97BNjtX047TgqURJOGCAQfykU1lMiV5pErQQvgEU; max-age=3600; path=/; samesite=strict; httponly

### Create a bookmark
